{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes:\nDesire & Cole are two cuddly friends looking for fun! They are very inquisitive and playful. They love to bird watch, eat and sleep, but a scratches are always welcome. They would do best in a quiet household, with a family who can engage and stimulate but let them roam.\n\nCole is a curious, sweet cat who rarely sits still. He's always up to something, whether it's looking out a window, playing by himself, spending time with Desire, or demanding pets. He is frequently chirping as he goes about his day. And when he's comfortable he sits with his back legs splayed out. Cole loves treats and being brushed.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=3&searchType=4&animalid=183802","id":"1d330d54881aecf83f67cee19fe1e200","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/a42ce80812af464b88fc469abaedcf79-1750795777-1750795869-png/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/6a008f38b8c24bd1a24ea917c138c844-1750795778-1750795856-png/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/e270c64b80364db4a903730540ef39a8-1750795777-1750795789-png/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/620afc998a1c4cb6a8e8fd27e8e68687-1750795776-1750795776-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/d2cc04c48cd948c582ad0d933a61359b-1745592717-1745592801-png/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/fc051f5971594b618fd200b9880d8cae-1745592718-1745592718-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/2dd759c2cf8243bd9f1538de6aaaae03-1743863988-1743863988-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/1947c9a9855941abaebfd162e105c58c-1743863986